    "detailed_description": "FRIGID IS A SURVIVAL EXPLORATION EXPERIENCE<br>Inspired by the Thing movies. Set in the Canadian arctic region where a cataclysmic event puts you in a desperate fight to survive nature. Climate researchers studying the contamination of arctic glaciers have found something disturbing in the area. Your job is to unravel the mystery of an infection spreading among the local wildlife and survive the ordeal.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><br>    <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>SCAVENGE, CRAFT, BUILD ITEMS TAILORED TO ARCTIC EXPERIENCE</li></ul>    <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>SINGLE PLAYER CAMPAIGN INTRIGUING STORY WITH EMOTIONAL SURVIVORS</li></ul>    <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>SURVIVAL EXPLORATION</li></ul>    <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>INFECTED ANIMALS</li></ul>    <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>PHYSICS INTERACTION</li></ul>    <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>ATMOSPHERIC GRAPHICS</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORATION</h2>    Play in a semi-open world environment as a retired hunter going on winter vacation. Explore every inch of this beautiful wildlife arctic environment.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1505850/extras/8f87997413a451d7a8515808e297515a.poster.avif?t=1726107068\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1505850/extras/8f87997413a451d7a8515808e297515a.webm?t=1726107068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1505850/extras/8f87997413a451d7a8515808e297515a.mp4?t=1726107068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SURVIVAL MECHANICS/CRAFTING</h2>    Build tools, weapons, and shelter to navigate, hunt, and provide protection.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1505850/extras/aaadc8a4efa7a98b4b1d4d3ccd816336.poster.avif?t=1726107068\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1505850/extras/aaadc8a4efa7a98b4b1d4d3ccd816336.webm?t=1726107068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1505850/extras/aaadc8a4efa7a98b4b1d4d3ccd816336.mp4?t=1726107068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>    Scavenge anything you can find to aid your survival. Use your creativity to put together and craft unique items tailored to the brutal arctic environment.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1505850/extras/d06d4201943de780a5066f065b61831c.poster.avif?t=1726107068\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1505850/extras/d06d4201943de780a5066f065b61831c.webm?t=1726107068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1505850/extras/d06d4201943de780a5066f065b61831c.mp4?t=1726107068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">INFECTED WILDLIFE</h2>     Survive and investigate deadly infected wildlife or find hope in survivors.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1505850/extras/190d2ffc99c9f1334374de10b417cf0c.poster.avif?t=1726107068\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1505850/extras/190d2ffc99c9f1334374de10b417cf0c.webm?t=1726107068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1505850/extras/190d2ffc99c9f1334374de10b417cf0c.mp4?t=1726107068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TOOLS AND WEAPONS</h2>    Find useful items to help you survive<br>    <u